---
// middleware.ts already redirects "/" (and any path with no locale
// prefix) before a request ever reaches this route, so this is a
// belt-and-suspenders fallback, not the primary redirect path. The
// return here matters: Astro.redirect() only takes effect if its
// Response is actually returned from the frontmatter -- calling it
// without `return` (as this previously did) silently does nothing.
return Astro.redirect("/es");
---
